prompts.text:
I want to run a conversus deliberation on this question:

> ${arguments.question}

Before running, analyze the question and recommend a mode (cooperative, winner-take-all, red-blue, or prisoners-dilemma). Present your recommendation as a table with Mode, Why, What to expect, and Cost. Then ask me to confirm before calling conversus_decide.

I want to stress-test this decision with a conversus red-blue deliberation:

> ${arguments.question}

Briefly explain what the red team will attack and what the blue team will defend. Then ask me to confirm before calling conversus_decide with mode red-blue.

I need a definitive answer on this — no 'it depends':

> ${arguments.question}

Explain the two competing positions and why winner-take-all mode is right for this question. Then ask me to confirm before calling conversus_decide with mode winner-take-all.
